@startuml

title Password Security Analyzer - Sequence Diagram

actor User

participant "Analyzer" as Analyzer
participant "Security Checks" as Checks
participant "Common Password Check" as Common
participant "Result Generator" as Results

User -> Analyzer : Enter password

Analyzer -> Checks : Perform security checks
Checks --> Analyzer : Return check results

Analyzer -> Common : Check if password is common
Common --> Analyzer : Return common status

Analyzer -> Analyzer : Calculate score
Analyzer -> Analyzer : Determine password strength

Analyzer -> Results : Generate feedback,\nrisk indicators & recommendation
Results --> Analyzer : Return analysis result

Analyzer --> User : Display password analysis

@enduml